Subject: [PATCH 28/29] [M156] [ServiceWorker] Invoke fetch response callbacks
 directly from Take()

Original change's description:
> [ServiceWorker] Invoke fetch response callbacks directly from Take()
>
> In ServiceWorkerGlobalScope::RespondToFetchEventWithNoResponse(), record
> the event in pending_streaming_upload_fetch_events_ before removing the
> response callback from fetch_response_callbacks_, and invoke
> OnFallback() directly on the returned wrapper rather than storing an
> intermediate raw pointer.
>
> Apply the same inline Take()->Value()->On*() pattern across the sibling
> RespondTo* methods in ServiceWorkerGlobalScope for consistency.
>
